        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Guac &amp; Load</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Guac &amp; Load</i> is a fast-paced restaurant sim where chaos in the kitchen turns into a fight for survival. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👨‍🍳 Start Your Shift</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook rice, beans, and meats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make some guac and stock your trays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build burrito bowls for customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run the register and keep the line moving</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800880/extras/18861eda6beadaaef662050825e40006.avif?t=1768490040\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧟 But Watch Out...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some customers can get aggressive, must be the Z-Coli outbreak!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab kitchen tools or the guac gun to fight back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive furious ex-customers and keep the restaurant alive</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800880/extras/195f2d558ec14434cc358e75dc4c7387.avif?t=1768490040\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌀 Gameplay Loop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each shift starts calm—just another day behind the counter. But after a while, everything changes. The pressure builds. The music shifts. The customers? Not so friendly anymore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✅ Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buying, cooking, chopping different types of food.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preparing customer's orders. A customer has a specific order that you must fulfill, you get money based on how accurate your order is.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies (infected by Z-Coli) will come and you'll need to fight to survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800880/extras/9599cd741a815c75a31bf2101f97f89c.avif?t=1768490040\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800880/extras_big/9599cd741a815c75a31bf2101f97f89c.webp?t=1768490040 width=1560 height=853 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Guac &amp; Load</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Guac &amp; Load</i> is a fast-paced restaurant sim where chaos in the kitchen turns into a fight for survival. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👨‍🍳 Start Your Shift</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook rice, beans, and meats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make some guac and stock your trays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build burrito bowls for customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run the register and keep the line moving</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800880/extras/18861eda6beadaaef662050825e40006.avif?t=1768490040\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧟 But Watch Out...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some customers can get aggressive, must be the Z-Coli outbreak!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab kitchen tools or the guac gun to fight back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive furious ex-customers and keep the restaurant alive</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800880/extras/195f2d558ec14434cc358e75dc4c7387.avif?t=1768490040\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌀 Gameplay Loop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each shift starts calm—just another day behind the counter. But after a while, everything changes. The pressure builds. The music shifts. The customers? Not so friendly anymore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✅ Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buying, cooking, chopping different types of food.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preparing customer's orders. A customer has a specific order that you must fulfill, you get money based on how accurate your order is.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies (infected by Z-Coli) will come and you'll need to fight to survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800880/extras/9599cd741a815c75a31bf2101f97f89c.avif?t=1768490040\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800880/extras_big/9599cd741a815c75a31bf2101f97f89c.webp?t=1768490040 width=1560 height=853 /></span></p>",
